// TEST: A Pack Written Both As A Group And Flat Is Refused (rejects)
// ERROR: BL3002 @ 10:18
// ERROR-CONTAINS: is a tuple among the Poly pack's flat elements
// ============================================================================
// `first_at((x, y), x, 1)` has a surplus argument, so the pack is written
// flat -- and its first element is a group. Both spellings at once has no
// reading; refused at the group.
// ============================================================================
function first_at(P: Poly<T^1>, k: Int64) = P[0](k)
let x = [1.0, 2.0, 3.0]
let r = first_at((x, [4.0, 5.0, 6.0]), x, 1)
